{"id":"wb-4-204","name":"胡里山炮台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"胡里山炮台","text":"胡里山炮台位于中国福建省厦门市。此清光绪二十年（1894年) 炮台使用德国克虏伯兵工厂制造的280毫米海岸炮为世界现存十九世纪制造最大。胡里山炮台于1996年列入第四批全国重点文物保护单位，2000年被编入吉尼斯世界纪录，2009年被评为中国国家4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%83%A1%E9%87%8C%E5%B1%B1%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":95367014,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95367014","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5ed29915bb6ab53e74f88288.jpg","title":"Hulishan_Fort,_2019-09-27_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hulishan_Fort,_2019-09-27_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/Hulishan_Fort%2C_2019-09-27_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​厦门胡里山炮台","width":320,"height":214}}